# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw, identifiable data. NEVER commit anything in here.
# These files carry IP addresses, geolocation and Prolific IDs. Consent item 8
# permits sharing anonymised data only. See data/raw/README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md
!data/raw/.gitkeep

# The pseudonym crosswalk re-identifies every participant. It is the one file
# that must never leave this machine.
**/participant_crosswalk.csv

# Qualtrics exports anywhere else in the tree, in case one gets misplaced
RCT_DataLiteracy*.csv
RCT_DelayedRetest*.csv

